<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-MOORE WINS MILWAUKEE.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-MOORE WINS MILWAUKEE.</headline>
<dateline>WEST ALLIS, Wis. 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Gregg Moore took his first Cart Indy car victory at the Milwaukee 200, in a Reynard Mercedes-Benz.</p>
<p>Michael Andretti finished second in a Swift Ford followed by Jimmy Vasser in a Reynard Honda.</p>
